॰ *The account of THE COMPRESSION RELATION follows and is kept, because the
॰ bound it stated is still the bound on the sites it did not take:*
॰
॰ THE PART BEFORE THIS ONE WAS **THE COMPRESSION RELATION** — the second
॰ family taken whole rather than a divider, and the family the slot-kind
॰ unit named as the border it would not cross: the six constants
॰ असम्बन्धः … प्रथमशून्यसम्बन्धः and the one parameter that reads them,
॰ अपाकर्तव्यम्'s `सम्बन्धः`. **7 sites and the census saw all seven.**
॰ `encode.t1` carried 51 `अ६४` and 135 `न६४`; it carried 44 and 142 after.
॰ Corpus ledger 586/0/792 -> 579/0/799, sum still 1378.
