॰ **606/0/772**, sum still 1378. THE FILE WAS STILL NOT REMEDIATED: the head
॰ declarations, the slot-kind predicates, placing a value into a field,
॰ bytes-and-words and diagnostics were untouched.
॰
॰ THE READING IS *THE NOT-FOUND ANSWER IS A LENGTH*, AND IT IS THE ONE THING
॰ ALL FIVE ROUTINES HAVE IN COMMON. The twin returns `Option<&Slot>` from
॰ `slots.iter().find(..)` (`encode.rs:230`, `:233`, `:241`, `:424`) or a
॰ `usize` from `.count()` (`:244`); T1 has no reference to return, so the
॰ port answers with `सङ्केतः ॱ अवकाशाः ॱ दैर्घ्य` — the index ONE PAST THE
॰ LAST SLOT — where Rust answers `None`. That is `अवग्रहान्वेषणम्`'s
॰ `अवसानम्` shape exactly, and `a_negative_sentinel_is_what_keeps_a_site_
॰ signed` is what makes it decide: a length is not -१, so no site here earns
॰ a sign. Everything else in the five is an index into `अवकाशाः`, an index
॰ into `पूरितानि`, a running count, or `नियततत्कालावकाशः`'s `क्रमः` — which
॰ is the twin's `n: usize` argument to `Iterator::nth`.
॰
॰ AND THE UNIT TAKES A CONSUMER WITH IT, WHICH NO PREVIOUS PART OF THIS FILE
॰ COULD. Cycle 524 LEFT `सङ्कोचनिषेधः`'s `गन्तृक्रमः` at `अ६४` under the rule
॰ *an index whose producer is outside the unit keeps its producer's spelling
॰ until the producer moves* — its producer being `आवरणावकाशः`, which is in
॰ THIS unit. The producer has now moved, so the binding moves with it in the
॰ same cycle and the rule is discharged rather than deferred. That is why
॰ item 4 of `the_signed_half_of_encode_t1_is_what_adr_0031_names` names
॰ `चरः गन्तृक्रमः ॱॱ अ६४` no longer: the check's own comment says to DELETE
॰ that part when the unsigned direction takes it, and this is that cycle.
॰ `गन्तृक्रमः` is only ever compared against two `दैर्घ्य` lengths and used
॰ to index `मूल्यानि` — and an index's spelling is independent of its
॰ slice's element type, as `अग्रिमतत्कालावकाशः` indexing an `अ३२` slice with
॰ `पूर्तिसूचकाङ्क` already shows.
॰
॰ THE OTHER FOUR ROUTINES HAVE NO CALLER AT ALL IN THE CORPUS — grepping all
॰ of `crates/sadhana-t1/src/*.t1` for नियततत्कालावकाशः, तत्कालावकाशः,
॰ कोष्ठसंख्यानम् and अग्रिमतत्कालावकाशः finds only their own definitions and
॰ `तत्कालावकाशः`'s one call inside this section. So the unit ends with NO
॰ disagreement outstanding anywhere, in either direction, and leaves the next
॰ cycle no handle — the same condition the fence table left, and for the same
॰ reason: sections of this file are consistent internally.
