॰ one candidate encoding — Encoding.
सार्वजनिक संरचना सङ्केत आरभ्य
  आज्ञा ॱॱ पाठ ऽ                    ॰ insn: RISC-V mnemonic, e.g. addi
  कुल ॱॱ पाठ ऽ                      ॰ family: Sassembly family key, e.g. add
  आकृति ॱॱ अ३२ ऽ                    ॰ pattern: fixed bits
  आवरण ॱॱ अ३२ ऽ                     ॰ mask: which bits the pattern constrains
  अंशसंख्या ॱॱ अ३२ ऽ                 ॰ bits: 16 or 32
  अवकाशाः ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अवकाश ऽ     ॰ slots: operand slots in written order
  विस्तार ॱॱ सम्भाव्य अ३२ ऽ           ॰ width: operand size in bits, when it has one
  परिवर्तनस्रोतः ॱॱ सम्भाव्य पाठ ऽ    ॰ converts.0: the type a conversion reads
  परिवर्तनगन्तृ ॱॱ सम्भाव्य पाठ ऽ     ॰ converts.1: the type it writes
  क्षेत्रस्वीकार ॱॱ बूल               ॰ takes_domains: true for fence and nothing else
समाप्तम् ।

॰ a diagnostic the encoder raised — EncodeError.
॰
॰ THE ARGS BECAME A RUN — 2026-08-30, and the change is one line of shape
॰ rather than a decision this file gets to make. `वाक्यविभाग ॱ वाक्यदोष`
॰ (vakyavibhaga.t1:312), the port of Rust's ParseError, already wrote
॰ "Rust's args: Vec<String> is a run in पाठांशकोश, in the order the
॰ template names them" — and `निदान ॱ पदार्थलेखनम्` (nidana.t1:821), which
॰ is the ONLY reader of a diagnostic's arguments in this tree, reads
॰ `वाक्यविभागॱपाठांशकोश` at `पदार्थारम्भ योगः अङ्कम्` and can read nothing
॰ else. So `आदानानि ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः पाठ` was an arena no renderer could
॰ reach, and this record was the one of the two that had not been brought
॰ to the convention. Nothing read it: `आदानानि` appeared exactly once in
॰ the whole crate, here.
सार्वजनिक संरचना सङ्केतनदोष आरभ्य
  पङ्क्ति ॱॱ न६४ ऽ                   ॰ line: 1-based
  सङ्केताङ्क ॱॱ पाठ ऽ                ॰ code: which diagnostic, from spec/diagnostics.tsv
  पदार्थारम्भ ॱॱ न६४ ऽ               ॰ args: first index into वाक्यविभागॱपाठांशकोश
  पदार्थसंख्यान ॱॱ न६४ ऽ             ॰ args: how many, in template order
  कारण ॱॱ पाठ                       ॰ reason: the message in the built-in language
समाप्तम् ।


