॰ WHETHER a span is a hexadecimal numeral — the question `षोडशाङ्कमूल्यम्`
॰ means when it refuses, asked of the TEXT so that a caller never has to read
॰ the answer off the VALUE.
॰
॰ IT EXISTS BECAUSE THE VALUE CANNOT CARRY THE ANSWER. `ir.t1` lowers
॰ `सम्भाव्य` as ONE WORD with ० meaning absent, so `Some(०)` and absence are
॰ the same bits in the image while the interpreter keeps them apart. A caller
॰ writing `मूल्यम् असमम् शून्यम्` therefore reads a legitimate `0x00000000`
॰ as PRESENT interpreted and as ABSENT natively — the two engines disagree by
॰ construction, and neither is wrong about its own representation.
॰
॰ That is not hypothetical here. Exactly one row of spec/encodings-riscv64.tsv
॰ has an all-zero pattern — line 60, `c.addi4spn` — and it was found by
॰ running, not by reading: the interpreter now records every comparison of a
॰ zero against absent (`zero_optional_witnesses` in nirvahana.rs) and a
॰ four-construct compile reported exactly one, at `सङ्केतसूचीरचना`'s `आकृतिः`.
॰ The count and the row agree, which is what makes the site a measurement.
॰ Without this predicate the compiled compiler leaves that row's
॰ `सङ्केतसूचीरूपसिद्धकोश` at ० and cannot encode `c.addi4spn` at all.
॰
॰ The margin below has said so since it was written: "an empty field is not
॰ the number zero ... answering ० here would put a pattern of all zeroes into
॰ the table instead." The condition was always known; what was missing was a
॰ way for a caller to ASK it.
सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः षोडशाङ्कवाचकः आदाय पाठ्यम् ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ आरम्भः ॱॱ न६४ सीमा ॱॱ न६४ ददाति बूल आदि
    चरः सूचकाङ्क ॱॱ न६४ भवति आरम्भः ।

    यदि आरभ्य सूचकाङ्क योगः १ समाप्तम् न्यूनम् सीमा आदि
        यदि पाठ्यम् अङ्कः सूचकाङ्क अन्तः समम् ४८ आदि
            यदि पाठ्यम् अङ्कः आरभ्य सूचकाङ्क योगः १ समाप्तम् अन्तः समम् १२० आदि
                सूचकाङ्क भवति सूचकाङ्क योगः २ ।
            इति
        इति
    इति

    यदि सूचकाङ्क समम् सीमा आदि
        प्रत्यागमनम् असत्यम् ।
    इति

    यावत् सूचकाङ्क न्यूनम् सीमा आदि
        यदि आरभ्य षोडशाङ्कः पाठ्यम् अङ्कः सूचकाङ्क अन्तः समाप्तम् समम् १६ आदि
            प्रत्यागमनम् असत्यम् ।
        इति
        सूचकाङ्क भवति सूचकाङ्क योगः १ ।
    इति

