॰ the क्रमः-th octet of a word, little-endian — the write half of
॰ `w.to_le_bytes()`, of which चतुरष्टकम् above is the read half.
॰ a caller writes only as many as the instruction occupies: a compressed
॰ form is the low halfword and writing four would put two zero octets
॰ where the next instruction goes.
