॰     — AND THAT IS THE SIXTH CLAUSE FOUND WRONG, 2026-08-31, BY WRITING
॰     THE BODY IT NAMES. `encode_collecting` is `स्थानसङ्केतनम्` and it is
॰     written; `सङ्केतनम्` is its one-line delegation and landed with it.
