॰     the estimate did not carry were the three routines the body needs
॰     that had no reason to exist before it — `अवकाशसंख्या` (an arena is
॰     born with one शून्यम्, so a slotless row reports दैर्घ्य १ and every
॰     walk written before this one would read that शून्यम् as a slot),
