॰ the whole row of a named encoding of a given width, as a `सङ्केत`; शून्यम्
॰ when the table carries no such row — Rust's `all.iter().find(|e| e.insn
॰ == insn && e.bits == 16)` at encode.rs:814, and with अंशाः ० the
॰ unconstrained `.find(|e| e.insn == decoded.insn)` at :806.
