॰ `कुलसङ्केतः` is this by FAMILY; `सङ्केताकृतिः` is this by name for ONE
॰ field. `सङ्कोचः` needs the slots and the pattern together, so the row is
॰ handed to `विश्लेषण ॱ पङ्क्तिसङ्केतः` whole, exactly as `कुलसङ्केतः` does.
