॰ ══════ WRITTEN 2026-08-31, AND THE ROW BELOW IT ASKED FOR IS PAID ══════
॰ The note that stood here said this routine was deferred because
॰ `the_corpus_carries_call_sites_that_cannot_be_executed`
॰ (tests/t1_execution.rs) loads `encode.t1` and `vakyavibhaga.t1` and
॰ nothing else, so "the first routine in this file to spend the
॰ `आयातः विश्लेषण ।` at the head owes ONE ROW in that list". It is spent
॰ here and in `कुलसङ्केतः` below and in `स्थानसङ्केतनम्` under both, and
॰ all three are rows of `NEEDS_A_MODULE_NOT_LOADED` in the same commit.
॰
॰ It was written before, and it worked: `takes_domains` is field ९ read as a
॰ shape list, `विश्लेषण ॱ क्षेत्रवाचकः` (vishlesana.t1:800) is that
॰ reader, and asserting it against spec/encodings-riscv64.tsv agreed for
॰ every family in the table — including that `क्षेत्रवाचकः`'s "opens with
॰ iorw" is the same question as Rust's `split(',').any(== "iorw")` over
॰ the rows that exist.
॰
॰ WHAT STOPPED IT: `the_corpus_carries_call_sites_that_cannot_be_executed`
॰ (tests/t1_execution.rs:656) loads `encode.t1` and `vakyavibhaga.t1` and
॰ NOTHING ELSE, then requires every routine it cannot run to appear in
॰ `NEEDS_A_MODULE_NOT_LOADED` (:653). A routine here that calls into
॰ `विश्लेषण` is unrunnable there by construction, exactly as `मूल्याङ्कः`
॰ and `सङ्केतनदोषवचनम्` already are — and both of those ARE listed. So the
॰ first routine in this file to spend the `आयातः विश्लेषण ।` at the head
॰ owes ONE ROW in that list, and the row's reason is the same as theirs.
॰ That file was outside this row's remit, so the routine is deferred
॰ rather than landed red. It belongs with `encode_collecting` anyway,
॰ which is its only caller and which will need `पङ्क्तिसङ्केतः` in the
॰ same commit.
॰
॰ WHY IT IS ASKED OF THE FAMILY AND NOT OF THE CHOSEN ROW, for whoever
॰ writes it: `B-107`. `पठनम्` is both "reading" and the memory-read
॰ domain, so reading a base as a domain EVERYWHERE made a label of that
॰ name definable and unreferenceable. The table already knows which
॰ encodings take one, so the family decides — and it must be decided
॰ BEFORE a row is chosen, because the operand counts that choose the row
॰ are themselves computed with this flag.
सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः कुलक्षेत्रयोग्यम् आदाय कुलम् ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ अंशाः ॱॱ अ६४ ददाति बूल आदि
    चरः कुलसंख्या ॱॱ अ६४ भवति कुलस्मरणम् कुलम् ।
    चरः क्रमः ॱॱ अ६४ भवति १ ।

    यावत् क्रमः न्यूनम् आरभ्य कुलसंख्या योगः १ समाप्तम् आदि
        चरः सूचीक्रमः ॱॱ अ६४ भवति स्मृतकुलक्रमकोश अङ्कः क्रमः अन्तः ।
        यदि सूचितांशसाम्यम् सूचीक्रमः अंशाः समम् सत्यम् आदि
            चरः सङ्केतः ॱॱ सङ्केत भवति सूचितसङ्केतः सूचीक्रमः ।
            ॰ 9201 — `सूचितसङ्केतः` returned a record. Absent = the FETCH faults.
            यदि विन्यासमुद्रणार्हम् समम् सत्यम् आदि
