॰ the same 64-bit pattern read as a signed number — Rust's `value as i64`,
॰ which `Slot::fits` performs on its own argument. `अन्तर्भावः` takes the
॰ two views SEPARATELY, T1 having no reinterpreting cast, so the caller
॰ does here what Rust does inside.
सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः चिह्नितमूल्यम् आदाय मूल्यम् ॱॱ अ६४ ददाति इ६४ आदि
    यदि मूल्यम् न्यूनम् ० आदि
