            ॰ E14 — अधिकरण is in D-02-C's table of five and in no example,
            ॰ and no encoding assigns it a field. It used to be treated as
            ॰ करण, which happened to give the right answer for a load and
            ॰ silently corrupted a store. Making it an alias for त् / य् is
            ॰ the tempting fix and it is wrong: two spellings for one role is
            ॰ what D-02-C exists to prevent, and for a store `खए` genuinely
            ॰ does not say whether ख is the address or the value (`O-02-2`).
            यदि भूमिका समम् ५ आदि
                पदार्थादिः भवति दोषपदार्थः मूलम् ।
