॰ assemble the pieces of an object — encode_object.
॰ `encode_object_for(program, Target::Uncompressed)` — `कार्यक्रमसङ्केतनम्`'s
॰ shape exactly, and left for the same one reason.
॰ ॥ PROBE — A LITERAL RUN VERSUS A SLICE-DERIVED RUN ॥ (2026-09-18)
॰ The native fault at vishlesana.t1 is a field write. Rung 96 ran the SAME write
॰ with a LITERAL and it answered ५०१२ natively. Rung 97 measured the slice: both
॰ sides give length ३, at the same byte offset, and the native stream is still an
॰ exact prefix — so the slice's VALUE is sound.
॰
॰ What differs between the write that works and the write that faults is where
॰ the run came from: a static literal in the data section, or a slice, which
॰ `ir.t1` builds as a FRESH BLOCK inline.
॰
॰ THIS LIVES IN `सङ्केतन` AND NOT IN `शृङ्खला` ON PURPOSE. The driver's dependency
॰ closure is 18 modules; this one's is 8, and a 3-module image measured 275 s
॰ against ~1,800 s for 21. Hosting a probe where its types live is what makes the
॰ cycle affordable — the entry does not have to be the driver.
॰
॰   answers ६००० + the field's length  the slice-derived write is fine; the
॰                                      difference is elsewhere in the sequence
॰   faults                             writing a slice-derived run into a record
॰                                      field faults natively while a literal does
॰                                      not — a FOUR-STATEMENT reproduction
॰ ॥ PROBE — THE SAME WRITE WITH WORK IN BETWEEN ॥ (2026-09-18)
॰ `खण्डलेखनपरीक्षा` below writes the field as the statement AFTER the declaration
॰ and answers ६००३ natively. The failing site declares `नव`, then runs four span
॰ lookups and builds a slice, and only then writes.
॰
॰ NATIVELY `भवति ०` PUTS ZERO IN A FRAME SLOT, so a field write through it should
॰ fault ALWAYS — and it does not when it is the next statement. Something keeps
॰ the value live across one statement that does not survive four. This corpus
॰ already records the shape: "loop-carried IR values must live in frame slots —
॰ intervals follow line order".
॰
॰ So this is the passing probe with WORK INSERTED between the declaration and the
॰ write, and nothing else changed. It is a bisect on the PROBE rather than on the
॰ compiler, which is only affordable because an 8-module image builds in 391 s.
॰
॰   ६००३   intervening work is not the difference either, and the state that
॰          matters is further away than four statements
॰   faults A FOUR-STATEMENT REPRODUCTION, and the subject is how a ०-declared
॰          record local survives across statements — not the write itself
सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः अन्तरालसहितलेखनपरीक्षा ददाति न६४ आदि
    चरः नव ॱॱ सङ्केत भवति ० ।
    चरः स्रोतः ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ भवति उक्तम् योगःपदम् इति ।
    चरः एकः ॱॱ अ६४ भवति क्षेत्रारम्भः स्रोतः ० ३ ० ।
    चरः द्वितीयः ॱॱ अ६४ भवति क्षेत्रसीमा स्रोतः ० ३ ० ।
    चरः तृतीयः ॱॱ अ६४ भवति क्षेत्रारम्भः स्रोतः ० ३ १ ।
    चरः चतुर्थः ॱॱ अ६४ भवति क्षेत्रसीमा स्रोतः ० ३ १ ।
    चरः खण्डः ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ भवति स्रोतः अङ्कः ० अन्तः ३ ।
    नव ॱ आज्ञा भवति खण्डः ।
    प्रत्यागमनम् ६००० योगः नव ॱ आज्ञा ॱ दैर्घ्य ।
